# Rifleman's native checks by parity: #111 Summon Bear, #117 Blaster, #127 Recoil Shot.
# Rifleman a against an idle Rifleman b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero rifleman
# #111: the bear toward b, cast frames 1-42; it reaches b.
60 a stick 1 0
60 a tap X 2
61 a stick 0 0
# #117: ground blaster, then a short-hop blaster.
150 a tap X 2
240 a tap B 1
245 a tap X 2
# #127: Recoil Shot, second shot on its frame 17.
330 a stick 0 1
330 a tap X 2
331 a stick 0 0
346 a tap X 2
# #111 counterplay: b's blaster hits a during the bear's cast, so no bear comes.
480 b tap X 2
486 a stick 1 0
486 a tap X 2
487 a stick 0 0
# #111: turn around, and the bear facing left.
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
640 a stick -1 0
642 a stick 0 0
660 a stick -1 0
660 a tap X 2
661 a stick 0 0
# View held again: the second moment.
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
#! expect a 60 special 5 form 0
#! expect b 99 damage 9.300
#! expect a 101 special 0
#! expect a 150 special 7 form 0
#! expect b 166 damage 13.020 hitlag 4 hitstun 11
#! expect a 187 special 0
#! expect a 245 applied jump
#! expect a 245 special 7 form 0
#! expect b 266 damage 15.810 hitlag 3 hitstun 8
#! expect a 268 special 0
#! expect a 330 special 6 form 0
#! expect a 346 special-form 1 action 6
# #252: first recoil rises 3.5 units faster for 13 frames before the second shot, adding 45.5 height.
#! expect a 363 special 0 form 1 action-frame 0 x -110.280 z 560.620
#! expect b 480 special 7
#! expect a 486 special 5 form 0
#! expect a 494 damage 3.720
#! expect a 494 special 0
#! absent b 496-650 damage
#! expect a 660 special 5 form 0
#! expect a 701 special 0
#! scene a BearOriginalClip
#! scene a FlyingMachineMissile
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
